  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A stencil airbrush painting of grey blocky buildings along a road under a sky of grey clouds on a pink to yellow gradient.",
    "description": "A square stencil airbrush painting on paper with an irregular sprayed edge. A sky that grades from hot pink at the top through peach to lemon yellow at the horizon is filled with soft grey cloud shapes. Below, blocky buildings rendered in grey gradients with white gaps between their faces line the right side of a wide grey road that recedes to the lower left, with a kerb and a smaller block at the far left. Everything but the sky is grey.",
    "impression": "A real Brooklyn street at the moment the sunset goes neon, with the buildings left in black and white as if they had not been told. The contrast between the hot sky and the grey city is the whole picture. Quiet, slightly surreal, like a memory with the colour drained except for the light.",
